## Introduction

**Core Synch Solutions** is a comprehensive educational platform that provides:
- **Document Conversion**: Convert PDFs and images to various formats (Word, PowerPoint, HTML, etc.)
- **Revision Materials**: Access past papers, marking schemes, notes, and textbooks
- **Flexible Subscriptions**: Individual and school-based plans with different feature access

### Key Features
- Convert PDF to DOCX, DOC, TXT, HTML, JSON, CSV, PPTX
- Free Word-to-PDF conversion
- OCR for scanned documents
- Revision materials for CBE and 8-4-4 curricula
- Individual and school subscription plans
- Advanced search and filtering
- User dashboard with activity tracking

---

## Getting Started

### For Individual Users

#### Step 1: Create an Account
1. Visit the homepage: http://127.0.0.1:8000/
2. Click **"Sign Up"** in the top navigation
3. Fill in your details:
   - Username
   - Email address
   - Password (minimum 8 characters)
4. Click **"Create Account"**

#### Step 2: Browse Features
- **Document Converter**: Upload and convert PDFs
- **Revision Materials**: Browse free materials (no subscription required)
- **Subscription Plans**: Upgrade for premium features

### For School Administrators

#### Step 1: Register Your School
1. Visit the homepage
2. Click **"Sign Up"**
3. Select **"Register a School instead"** link
4. Fill in school details:
   - School name
   - School address
   - Phone number
   - Email
   - Principal name
   - Username and password
5. Click **"Create Account"**

#### Step 2: Subscribe to a Plan
1. After registration, you'll be redirected to subscription plans
2. Choose a plan suitable for your school
3. Complete payment via M-Pesa
4. Subscription activates immediately

---

## Document Conversion

### Free Conversion: Word to PDF

**No payment required!**

1. Scroll to the **"Word to PDF Converter"** section (green card)
2. Click **"Choose File"** or drag-and-drop a .docx file
3. Click **"Convert to PDF"**
4. Wait for conversion to complete
5. Click **"Download PDF"**

**Supported format**: .docx only

### Paid Conversion: PDF to Other Formats

**Cost**: KSH 2 per page

#### Step 1: Upload File
1. Go to the main converter section
2. Click **"Choose File"** or drag-and-drop a PDF/image
3. Supported formats: PDF, PNG, JPG, JPEG, GIF, BMP

#### Step 2: Configure Settings
- **Output Format**: Select from:
  - Word Document (.docx)
  - Word 97-2003 (.doc)
  - Text File (.txt)
  - HTML Document (.html)
  - JSON Data (.json)
  - CSV Spreadsheet (.csv)
  - PowerPoint (.pptx)
- **Use OCR**: Check this box for scanned documents (requires subscription)

#### Step 3: Convert and Pay
1. Click **"Convert Now"**
2. System shows estimated pages and cost
3. After conversion, click **"Pay with M-Pesa"**
4. Enter your M-Pesa phone number
5. Complete payment
6. Download your converted file

### Conversion History
- View all your conversions in **Dashboard** → **Recent Conversions**
- Download completed files anytime
- Track your spending

---

## Revision Materials

### Browsing Materials

#### Option 1: Browse by Curriculum
1. Click **"Revision"** in the navigation menu
2. Choose your curriculum:
   - **CBE** (Competency-Based Education)
   - **8-4-4** (Traditional curriculum)
3. Select your level:
   - Primary School
   - Secondary School
   - College/University
4. Click on a class to view subjects
5. Select a subject to see available materials

#### Option 2: Browse by Subject
1. From Revision home, click **"Browse by Subject"**
2. See all subjects with available materials
3. Filter by curriculum (CBE or 8-4-4)
4. Click on a subject to view materials

#### Option 3: Advanced Search
1. Click **"Search"** in the navigation menu
2. Use filters:
   - **Keyword**: Search by title, subject, or description
   - **Type**: Past Paper, Marking Scheme, Notes, Textbook
   - **Class**: Filter by specific class
   - **Term**: Term 1, 2, or 3
   - **Year**: Select academic year
   - **Price**: Free or Paid materials
   - **Sort**: Newest, Oldest, Most Downloaded, Title
3. Click **"Search"** to see results

### Material Types
- **Past Papers**: Previous exam papers
- **Marking Schemes**: Official answers and grading rubrics
- **Notes**: Study notes and summaries
- **Textbooks**: Digital textbook resources

### Accessing Materials

#### Free Materials
- No subscription required
- Available to all users (including anonymous)
- Click **"View"** to see details
- Click **"Download"** to get the file

#### Premium Materials
- Requires active subscription with revision access
- Click **"View"** to see details
- If you have access: Download immediately
- If not: You'll be prompted to subscribe

### Material Details Page
- Title and description
- Subject and class information
- Material type and term
- Price (Free or KSH amount)
- Download count
- Preview text (first pages)
- Related materials (e.g., past paper + marking scheme)

---

## Subscriptions & Plans

### Plan Types

#### For Individual Users
- **Personal Learning Plan**: KSH 500/year
  - Revision materials access
  - PDF conversions
- **Student Premium**: KSH 1,000/year
  - Full access including OCR
  - Unlimited conversions

#### For Schools
- **School Basic**: KSH 2,000/year
  - PDF conversions only
  - Up to 10 teachers
- **School Standard**: KSH 3,500/year
  - Conversions + Revision materials
  - Unlimited teachers
- **School Premium**: KSH 5,000/year
  - Full access including OCR
  - Unlimited everything

### Subscribing to a Plan

#### Step 1: View Available Plans
1. Click **"Subscription Plans"** in navigation
2. See plans available for your account type:
   - **Individual users**: See individual and "both" plans
   - **School users**: See school and "both" plans

#### Step 2: Select a Plan
1. Click **"Subscribe Now"** on your chosen plan
2. Review plan details:
   - Name and price
   - Duration (Termly/Yearly)
   - Features included
3. Click **"Subscribe"**

#### Step 3: Complete Payment
1. Enter your M-Pesa phone number
2. Click **"Pay with M-Pesa"**
3. You'll receive an M-Pesa prompt on your phone
4. Enter your PIN to complete payment
5. Subscription activates immediately

### Managing Your Subscription

#### View Current Subscription
- Go to **Dashboard**
- Check **Subscription Status** card
- See active plan and expiry date

#### Renew Subscription
1. Go to **Subscription Plans**
2. If you have an active subscription, you'll see it
3. Click **"Renew"** when near expiry
4. Complete payment

### Plan Features

#### Revision Access
- Allows viewing and downloading revision materials
- Some plans exclude revision (conversion-only plans)
- Check plan details before subscribing

#### PDF Conversion
- Convert PDFs to various formats
- KSH 2 per page
- OCR for scanned documents (premium feature)

#### OCR (Optical Character Recognition)
- Converts scanned/image PDFs to text
- Requires premium subscription
- Useful for non-selectable text

