## User Dashboard

### Accessing Your Dashboard
1. Login to your account
2. Click **"Dashboard"** in the navigation menu

### Dashboard Sections

#### Stats Overview
- **Total Conversions**: Number of files you've converted
- **Total Spent**: Amount paid for conversions
- **Materials Downloaded**: Revision materials downloaded
- **Subscription Status**: Active/Pending/None

#### Recent Conversions
- Shows your last 10 conversions
- File name, format, and status
- Download button for completed files
- Link to full conversion history

#### Quick Actions
- **New Conversion**: Go to converter
- **Revision Materials**: Browse materials
- **Subscription**: View/upgrade plan
- **Profile**: View account details

#### Popular Revision Materials
- Trending free materials
- Quick access to popular resources
- Download directly from dashboard

